"text": "Every gate is one entry of the fence below, in the order /implement runs it. The real boot smoke of the windowed stand is the `smoke` entry (it needs `WAYLAND_DISPLAY`; unset, it reads `not run` and the windowed build stays proven by the `build` entry and CI). The CI-reading acceptance spans two runs by construction, so the operator's commit and push precede the CI read. No `leg = 'live'` entry: no external process is driven. The coverage leg runs locally because this chunk moves its configuration and the gate it guards is the one at risk."
}
